# Per-cell bank generation ~33s warm on T4; cold model load is far longer, so a
# short timeout aborts the first request. Server B pre-warms its default models
# on boot (AI_PREWARM); this headroom covers cold loads of non-default attempts.
# Keep below the nginx /api/ proxy_read_timeout (600s) on the deployed stack.
AI_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS=540000
